sequenceDiagram
    participant C as LatestFrameCapture
    participant W as Cheap Watcher
    participant X as Camera Controller
    participant S as Central Scheduler
    participant P as Pose/Tracker
    participant K as Kinematics + 6-class
    participant T as TCN
    participant F as Fusion/Event
    participant U as Browser/API

    C->>W: latest valid frame + timestamp
    W->>X: motion score / rapid / scene change

    alt EMPTY and quiet
        X->>S: low-priority person probe
        S->>P: latest frame only
        P-->>X: person absent/present
    else rapid motion
        X->>S: P1 burst Pose request
        S->>P: latest frame only
        P-->>K: track skeleton + capture timestamp
        K-->>F: global descent / rotation / posture
        P-->>T: actual-time 10 Hz sample
        T-->>F: ready + temporal probability
        F-->>X: candidate or safe
    end

    alt candidate
        X->>S: P0 verify requests
        S->>P: latest frames at 10~20 Hz
        P-->>K: verified track observations
        K-->>F: kinematic evidence
        T-->>F: temporal persistence
        F-->>U: SHADOW_ALERT / ALERT event
    else safe
        F-->>U: status snapshot
    end

